WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.480
Today the boxes are gone.

2
00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:04.509
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:05.009 --> 00:00:08.720
In place of the boxes there is a line, with three dots under it.

4
00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:15.306
Say the name of the picture. Jet. Your child taps three fingers on the table, one for each sound.

5
00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:22.193
Then your child writes the word on the line, one letter above each dot.

6
00:00:27.879 --> 00:00:28.954
The word is jet.

7
00:00:29.854 --> 00:00:35.867
If a sound goes missing today, go back to a finger for each sound. The fingers are the boxes now.

8
00:00:36.317 --> 00:00:41.212
Do the two pictures in job one together. Then name the six pictures in job two.

9
00:00:41.662 --> 00:00:47.051
Your child writes all six words first. Then press play on the sound track, and step away.

10
00:00:47.501 --> 00:00:52.495
At the end, you say three of the words, and your child writes them again on the back of the page.
